# An application configuration with logging at the fixed root section "Log".
--[ Application ]-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Name                        : "Explorer Guild"

--[ Log ]-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
----[ . Format ]
Pattern                     : "{level} [{name}] {message}"

---*[ . Writers ]*
Type                        : "console"
Levels                      : "information", "warning", "error"
Paths                       : "application"
